[en.FOCUS_C02_AS_A_DUKE]
Accepting Title

[en.FOCUS_C02_AS_A_DUKE_desc]
The summer of 1002, after the coronation ceremony of Empress Cozy Glow, the ceremony of the enfeoffment of the Duchesses of the imperial territories was held at the Palace. According to the ritual procedure that had been finalized last year, Trixie Lulamoon, as the model governor of the imperial territory and the undisputed champion of the first Ponyville election, was awarded the title of Duchess, and Cozy Glow herself crowned her with the ducal crown — but of course, Cozy Glow did not welcome her with a smile. In fact, Cozy Glow regretted very much why she had announced Trixie as the model governor of the imperial territory so early last year, which made it almost impossible for her to remove her from this position, unless she made some serious mistakes. Cozy Glow had tried to look up old records, about what Trixie had done in the Ultimate Battle, about Trixie’s relationship with Starlight, about the “Ghost Train” incident report, about the trade agreement between Ponyville and Appleloosa... But the clever as Trixie, apparently, would not leave any evidence behind — “Was the winter of 1001 a particularly bad one? No, it was a marvelous winter, we lost no ends of embarrassing documents in the snow flood.”

[zh.FOCUS_C02_AS_A_DUKE]
接受册封

[zh.FOCUS_C02_AS_A_DUKE_desc]
1002年夏，在和煦光流女皇的加冕仪式结束后，小马利亚帝国地区领主册封仪式也在帝国皇宫举行。按照去年就已经敲定好的仪式流程，特丽克西·卢拉月作为模范地区总督和第一届小马谷选举无可争议的冠军当选者，被授予公爵头衔，和煦光流亲自为她戴上了公爵冠冕——但是当然，和煦光流并没有以笑脸相迎。事实上，和煦光流十分后悔为什么去年早早地将特丽克西对外宣布为模范地区总督，这使得和煦几乎没法再将她从这个职位上撤下来——除非她犯下了什么严重的错误。和煦光流曾试图查阅旧资料，关于特丽克西在终末之战中所做的事，关于特丽克西与星光的关系，关于“幽灵列车”事故报告，关于与小马谷与苹果鲁萨的贸易协定... 但聪明的特丽克西显然不会留下任何把柄——“1001年的冬天很恶劣吗？不，那个冬天很不错，我们在雪灾中丢失了无数棘手的文件。”

